  "which-train": {"text": "Melyik vonat megy...?", "say": "ME-yeek VO-not medj ...", "note": "Hungarian adds endings instead of words like to: Debrecen becomes Debrecenbe (DEB-re-tsen-be), to Debrecen. The audio uses it as the example", "spoken": "Melyik vonat megy Debrecenbe?", "filled": "Melyik vonat megy ⟦Debrecenbe⟧?"},
